      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a way to distract myself. like, why bother building those \"small moments\" if the end result is always just... nothing? it feels like we're just delaying the inevitable. it's like being forced to watch a movie you already know is going to be bad, but you're stuck in the theater and can't leave.",
